%------------------------- OFTPD - Delete a Partner -/-/------------------------
+
+
%  Partner  @OFTENAM +is deleted from the partner table of OFTPD.
+
+  Its definition, with the passwords, is gone for good. OFTPD refuses while
+  a transfer in the spool still names the partner, or a session runs; the
+  partner is disabled then. Remove transfers in the transfer list (D) or
+  with PURGE.
+
!OFTMSG
+
+  Enter deletes the partner, END leaves it as it is.
)END
